{"articleNo":"539255","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=539255&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[학적] 2025학년도 2학기 전공배정 신청기간 안내(기계/산업·빅데이터/재료/화학소재/자율전공학부)","writer":"교무과","writeDate":"2025.10.15","hit":"9378","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -14.8pt; font-size: 18pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; background-color: rgb(124, 67, 177); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">2025</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -14.8pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; background-color: rgb(124, 67, 177); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">학년도</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; background-color: rgb(124, 67, 177); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;2</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -14.8pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; background-color: rgb(124, 67, 177); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">학기 전공배정 신청기간을</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -14.8pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; background-color: rgb(124, 67, 177); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;다음과 같이 안내드리니,&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -14.8pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; background-color: rgb(124, 67, 177); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">기간 내 신청하시기</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; background-color: rgb(124, 67, 177); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"text-indent: -14.8pt; font-size: 18pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(124, 67, 177); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -14.8pt; font-size: 18pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; background-color: rgb(124, 67, 177); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">.</span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.8; word-break: break-all;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">1. 신청 대상:&nbsp;</span></span><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Verdana, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">기계공학부, 산업·빅데이터공학부, 재료공학부, 화학소재공학부, 자율전공학부 소속 재학생</span></font></b></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.8; word-break: break-all;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; line-height: 1.8; word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Verdana, sans-serif\">&nbsp; ※ 2024학년도 이전 학과(전공을 운영하지 않은 학부 포함)로 입학한 학생의 경우, 전공배정 경과조치에 따라 교무과에서 전공 입력(직접 신청 불필요)</font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">2. 신청 기간</span></b></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Verdana, sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; - 기계공학부, 산업·빅데이터공학부, 자율전공학부: 2025.11.03.(월)</span></b></font><b style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;09:00:01</span></b><b style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;~ 11.07.(금)</span></b><b style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;23:59:59</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Verdana, sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; - 재료공학부, 화학소재공학부: 2025.11.10.(월) 09:00:01 ~ 11.14.(금) 23:59:59</span></b></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Verdana, sans-serif\">&nbsp; <span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">※ </span>학부별 신청 기간 이외에는 시스템 접속 및 전공배정 신청 불가</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\">3. 신청 방법: 통합정보시스템-학적-전공배정신청</span></b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Verdana, sans-serif\">※ <span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">본인 희망 전공 순으로 학부 내 전공을 모두 신청</span>하여야 하며, <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\">희망 전공 선택 후 반드시 저장, 신청을 클릭하여야 전공배정 신청이 완료됨</span></b></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Verdana, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (학부내 전공이 3개일 경우 3개의 전공을 본인 희망 전공 순으로 모두 신청)</font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><b style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">4. 향후 일정</span></b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">[2학기 성적 확정 후]</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; -</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><b><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Verdana, sans-serif\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">전공배정</span> 변경신청기간:&nbsp;</span></font><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Verdana, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">2026.01.07.(수) ~ 01.09.(금) [자율전공학부는 변경신청기간 없음(미운영)]</span></font></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; - <b>전공배정 심사기간:&nbsp;</b></span><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Verdana, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><b>2026.01.14.(수) ~ 01.16.(금)</b></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; -</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">전공배정 확정:&nbsp;</span><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Verdana, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">2026.01.21.(수) [예정]</span></font></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; margi